# GrayScope — environment variables (example)
# Copy to ".env" and adjust. The real ".env" is git-ignored.
#
# NOTE: Graylog tokens are NOT stored here. They are entered through the UI,
# encrypted with Fernet, and persisted in the local SQLite database.

# Override the directory that holds the Fernet key file (secret.key).
# Defaults to "~/.grayscope" when unset.
# GRAYSCOPE_KEY_DIR=

# Override the SQLite database file location.
# Defaults to "<project>/data/grayscope.db" when unset.
# GRAYSCOPE_DB_PATH=
